Copyright 2026 JaeLi0 (modifications)

This product is a modified version of Datus-agent
(https://github.com/Datus-ai/Datus-agent), developed by the Datus Team and
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The Python package in this repository is named `dataengineer`. Modifications
include, but are not limited to:
  - New predictive modeling sub-agent `gen_model`
    (dataengineer/agent/node/gen_model_agentic_node.py,
     dataengineer/prompts/prompt_templates/gen_model_system_1.0.j2)
  - New modeling tools (dataengineer/tools/model_tools/)
  - New JOIN path tool (dataengineer/tools/func_tool/join_path_tools.py)
  - Registration of the new sub-agent and tools in the node factory,
    the main agent's delegation tool and the web UI
  - Evaluation code and benchmark tasks (eval/), unit tests

Datasets used in evaluation are not redistributed. They are available from
the UCI Machine Learning Repository and the Monash Time Series Forecasting
Repository under CC BY 4.0.
